{
  "name": "Generate AI images with gpt-image-2 and post them to Instagram and Pinterest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate AI images with gpt-image-2 and post them to Instagram and Pinterest\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the imagePrompt used to build the post.\n3. Generates the image with OpenAI (gpt-image-2).\n4. Publishes posts to Instagram and Pinterest via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Connect your OpenAI account in the Generate Image (gpt-image-2) node.\n- [ ] In the Set image idea node, set the imagePrompt to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Set your Pinterest board ID in the Publish to Pinterest node.\n- [ ] Make sure an upstream node provides the image as binary data for Instagram.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the imagePrompt in the Set image idea node to publish different content.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 674
      },
